The drawings in 20/ and 24/ are the Material Symbols Outlined style at weight
400 and grade 0, in the 20 px and 24 px optical sizes. A file named
<glyph>-fill.svg is the fill 1 variant of <glyph>.

The files are unchanged. The build compiles each pair into one React component
and copies the path data across verbatim, so what a page draws is what upstream
drew. SHA256SUMS records the checksum of every file.

The Apache License 2.0 text is in LICENSE beside this file, and it covers these
drawings only. The rest of @crewlethq/icons is under the MIT License in the
package's own LICENSE.
